From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sr-0w <Sr-0w@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 00:50:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: hotdog: enable the camera subsystem

Turn on CAMSS and both CCI blocks so the subsystem probes on hardware. No
sensor is described yet, so nothing streams; this is the step that proves the
clocks, power domains and register map are right before sensor wiring adds a
second unknown.

Signed-off-by: Sr-0w <Sr-0w@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-hotdog.dts | 12 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-hotdog.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-hotdog.dts
@@ -766,6 +766,18 @@
  * is worse than not offering it at all.
  */
 
+&cci0 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&cci1 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&camss {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &mdss_dsi0_phy {
 	vdds-supply = <&vreg_l5a_0p875>;
 	status = "okay";
--
2.50.1
